;; Synthetic fixture for the ledger-check action and hooks (w22/m5): the
;; lunch transaction is short 1 USD on purpose, so `bea check` reports
;; line 7 and `bea format --check` flags the file.
2026-01-01 open Assets:Cash USD
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Food USD

2026-01-02 * "Lunch"
  Assets:Cash  -10 USD
  Expenses:Food  9 USD
